WHO   — The Descolada — the virus that writes life
WHAT  — A self-modifying, semi-intelligent virus native to Lusitania that rewrote every native species to depend on it.
WHERE — EN1 · Enderverse  Framework inputs: the Ender Quintet  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
